Description: A living Tux companion for the Linux desktop
 Compa is a small, borderless, animated Tux that lives on your desktop:
 breathes, blinks, walks, reacts to clicks, and has five personalities
 that change its pace and behaviour.
 .
 It is purely decorative and emotional by design — no system monitoring,
 no notifications, no productivity panel.
